    A reflection contributes as x/(x+nearest), where "x"  
    is the fraction of the total area of the current phase and 
   "nearest" is the number of adjacent reflections verifying the formula:

    Postn-p*FWHM <= Postn(adjacent) <= Postn+p*FWHM 

   "nearest" is weighted by the corresponding "x(s)" 

